<h3 local-id=3D"139c4ec2-b712-472e-a7af-94978512dad7" id=3D"OptimisingStora=
geforAxonTransactionDatabasewithDBPartitioningandEncodingTechniques-Overvie=
w">Overview</h3>
<p local-id=3D"5f1542bb-dc83-42c1-a433-048081ea974d">Axon Transaction Datab=
ase is grown rapidly with increase of traffic where-in we are receiving tra=
ffic of size 3M transactions per day on average, resulting in data growth o=
f&gt;2 TB data every month, because of which we are running ATS DB on high =
resources.<br><br>
In future this going to increase more, it would be difficulty to increase r=
esources after certain point and performance will go down, So in order to a=
ccount this we accounted for DB growth with DB Partitioning but still as da=
ta size is &gt;2 TB per month we want to optimise storage.</p>
<p local-id=3D"ea18d6c4-3e6f-45d6-9c81-35a8e2bb0db9"></p>
<p local-id=3D"0ff57fc7-1eeb-437e-9976-981e76994e5c">EPIC: <a class=3D"exte=
rnal-link" data-card-appearance=3D"inline" href=3D"https://zeta-axon.atlass=
ian.net/browse/ACO-5783" local-id=3D"5672767b-2b91-495f-86a9-408dedf30f2f" =
rel=3D"nofollow">https://zeta-axon.atlassian.net/browse/ACO-5783</a></p>
<p local-id=3D"7a6e24fd-0660-4bb1-9202-f4a2246d339a">EPIC: <a class=3D"exte=
rnal-link" data-card-appearance=3D"inline" href=3D"https://zeta-axon.atlass=
ian.net/browse/ACO-6068?focusedCommentId=3D113487" local-id=3D"87544e79-995=
0-41f5-b36e-48ea5135f42e" rel=3D"nofollow">https://zeta-axon.atlassian.net/=
browse/ACO-6068?focusedCommentId=3D113487</a> <br></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"9fdc3002-c9f4-44af-adb2-110a8f437b3c" id=3D"OptimisingStora=
geforAxonTransactionDatabasewithDBPartitioningandEncodingTechniques-Storage=
Optimisationonrow-columns"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=
=3D"4ac17cc4-9f04-406a-b469-087ff6533921">Storage Optimisation on row-colum=
ns</span></h3>
<p local-id=3D"fbc1d3b2-a924-4ac6-8b8e-9b9a46bc7e9a"></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"9ac8e067-2d6e-418f-83c5-0d45ff7914c9">
<li local-id=3D"84a6b75d-fa73-4a4b-88f5-43f691ec839d">
<p local-id=3D"07bdbb52-b076-4c6b-bdd5-d9bd36e9c678">At present ATS has 4 m=
ain tables namely</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"e6a8a3c6-5442-41e9-bd3f-7dd9774612b9">
<li local-id=3D"f6d221de-62b9-4a5a-bda5-c42e1c85fb3f">
<p local-id=3D"e3ad6ea2-9f65-48b2-8ca9-fa5902376bc7">Outstanding Transactio=
n Child (OTC)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4a2dc4b2-a81e-435c-a204-73a9cf947b4c">
<p local-id=3D"64a5bab7-f9c9-4584-9dca-9fc177ff40b4">Outstanding Transactio=
n Master (OTM)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d6a0e16c-b1a7-420f-934d-bed79a170eda">
<p local-id=3D"36eb4872-ddb9-4cda-a25c-70669f774f75">Transaction Child (TC)=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8e57cdb3-350e-461a-9274-46b2a23625dd">
<p local-id=3D"e513354b-300f-4359-a2f9-b5a21b653b80">Transaction Master (TM=
)<br>
In which OTC and TC consumes more memory as it stores complete payload in f=
orm JSON and JSON B columns. At present these tables are consuming with max=
 size of 6000Bytes in auth message and 5000Bytes for advice messages per ro=
w and in which major contribution is from columns of OTC and TC tables name=
ly</p></li>
</ol></li>
</ol>
