<h3 local-id=3D"f1a3780c-d24f-48cd-baa0-bfb90f698321" id=3D"OptimisingStora=
geforAxonTransactionDatabasewithDBPartitioningandEncodingTechniques-Storage=
OptimisationTechniques.">Storage Optimisation Techniques.</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"eee7f4c6-932c-4f2c-9578-2babd5e0a076">
<li local-id=3D"c98f962b-d5de-4f0f-835e-d93a379a631b">
<p local-id=3D"dd6956d9-71ba-4d6e-96a5-f1563a93ebf2">Payload should be enco=
ded and stored in DB by mapping keys to a numeric fields in a new column af=
ter this change to make backward compatible and in select queries after thi=
s change before returning to core logic update with actual decoded data .</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"14907f9b-f3df-4c22-a9c6-d00b7f57d77a">
<p local-id=3D"1d09b937-7e64-4da9-9cb5-367e986ad3eb">This is also controlle=
d by boolean environment variable =E2=80=9C<code>ENABLE_PAYLOAD_COMPRESSION=
</code>"<br></p></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
