nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3fb74b4b-37a1-4d85-86f9-1e13b6e54fcb">With this size reduces=
 by 30% of this column storage<br>
-&gt; It should reduce 100 GB atleast in each OTC table and TC table per mo=
nth</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a0e3169e-ef05-47a9-a572-8e7af5f28efd">
