nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6532f437-76c9-407b-963a-3f2009f37caf">with this an average o=
f 500Bytes will be reduced.&gt; It should reduce 41 GB atleast in each OTC =
table and TC table per month</p></td>
</tr>
