</div>
<p local-id=3D"bd1f5d50-edaa-4812-b349-58909305638e"></p>
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"6280c036-705e-41b6-bfee-ac214e32e98a">
<li local-id=3D"cced5a7c-ccff-4611-b3f3-0a411b595670">
<p local-id=3D"1c328779-cb32-4430-8e11-c2e2ceef7ff0">Fix issue of multiple =
times stringfied json string storage in TC tables while moving records from=
 OTC tables.</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"fca845e7-cf78-40b7-845c-36c8bd455a65">
<li local-id=3D"3c8eceb8-2a7f-4834-909e-83dbb19184f1">
<p local-id=3D"ba5da251-c919-4213-89e5-b256f5b58560">At present when moving=
 records, stringified values getting stringfied again as a result extra bac=
kslashes are coming into picture which results in increase in storage by 30=
% in json columns, so as part of this we should fix this as well.<br></p></=
li>
</ol></li>
<li local-id=3D"d1ae4ca2-f343-4fe8-bab7-f9a27fbb786d">
<p local-id=3D"603e21c2-93da-4b34-aca1-cd41c8329257"><span class=3D"inline-=
comment-marker" data-ref=3D"8c0e4a6b-dc81-455d-ba66-2fa412f2a387">Removing =
un-required fields from OTC and TC tables json columns.(effective reduction=
 of additional 30% from this column)</span></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"087e5236-d95a-41cc-9136-fa5cbfe636ba">
<li local-id=3D"ca9d2ce0-3a5c-4159-b4d6-96f2f5221519">
<p local-id=3D"5088c253-f6ce-4d75-89fa-c9aa651f08db">Remove =E2=80=9CfinalA=
uthorization=E2=80=9D from payload is not being used, this should happen fo=
r all TC entries and OTC entries</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6379b528-435e-4987-be8d-5afcacc022f6">
<p local-id=3D"4cb455ef-c40c-4528-8023-b047876fbc09">Replace =E2=80=9Crespo=
nseISoFields=E2=80=9D for 0120, 0220, 0420, 0140 Messages , with new messag=
e =E2=80=9CresponseISoFields=E2=80=9D only store MTI.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3ad892aa-4da3-4011-85c6-536378b95f47">
<p local-id=3D"1be271b1-996a-4de3-a886-6ed60fad01ff">Don=E2=80=99t store =
=E2=80=9CprocessedFields=E2=80=9D =3D&gt; as these values are always consta=
nt, just make sure before pushing to transactionData it contains this const=
ant data.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"53e68c9c-c80b-4ce5-b168-641e44d8a59b">
<p local-id=3D"fc849367-7554-41fe-afed-9b7387f3b808">Remove Original Messag=
e from payload, it is already added in different column</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e409ac93-7584-485a-b309-ac15ce465de8">
<p local-id=3D"354cccd8-e7a6-40c6-bca2-0196e0e31c79">Remove Institution log=
 details as well while storing.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d0a20493-d417-4d45-8136-a85c46c90999">
<p local-id=3D"7f01366d-e260-494c-a768-10598b4ff237">Remove authorizations =
object as well, except for 0220, when moving records to TC</p></li>
</ol></li>
<li local-id=3D"3524bf5d-a2f3-4a83-af9b-f85ba5dfca5b">
<p local-id=3D"145a6aee-01db-466b-84cb-cd8d0b98b305">
<del><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"e95e9ccd-37e0-4e96-9=
d12-7e282418d7a5">Move declined messages from OTC/ OTM tables to TC and TM =
after 7 Days, </span>add required code changes in release transaction api f=
low. Update Pg_partman policy for OTC/OTM tables to hold only 2 months data=
, with this we can reduce data storage by 600GB.</del></p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"5b1a40f7-2a6b-4a93-8344-878dc037a0cb"></p>
<p local-id=3D"d632fdd7-c887-4e9e-924b-701db6d46cca"></p>
